                <ITEXT FONT="Lato Regular" FONTSIZE="9.3" FCOLOR="GuideInk" CH="Set the status to disabled from the settings card. Disabled organisations cannot mint new tokens; existing tokens remain valid until their natural expiry. To force immediate logout of every user in the organisation, revoke their sessions individually (see Part VII, Chapter 1)."/>
