                <ITEXT FONT="Lato Regular" FONTSIZE="9.3" FCOLOR="GuideInk" CH="Failed deliveries (transport error or non-2xx) re-queue with an exponential backoff: 30s → 5m → 30m → 6h → 24h, capped at 5 attempts before the row is marked exhausted. After 20 consecutive failures the endpoint is auto-disabled so we stop hammering a dead receiver."/>
