                <ITEXT FONT="Lato Regular" FONTSIZE="9.3" FCOLOR="GuideInk" CH="The audit page supports filtering by event type (substring), outcome, actor UUID, project UUID, target type, correlation ID, and date range. Non-super-admins are scoped — they only see entries tied to a project they can access, plus system-wide entries with no project_id."/>
